feature-strip studio-wrap home-only" id="features" aria-label="Invitation features"><article><span class="occasion-icon feature-icon" style="--occasion-hue:#C2415B"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="18" height="7" x="3" y="3" rx="1"/><rect width="9" height="7" x="3" y="14" rx="1"/><rect width="5" height="7" x="16" y="14" rx="1"/></svg></span><div><h3>Beautiful templates</h3><p>Thoughtful designs for life’s most meaningful moments.</p></div></article><article><span class="occasion-icon feature-icon" style="--occasion-hue:#6A4FB0"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21.64 3.64-1.28-1.28a1.21 1.21 0 0 0-1.72 0L2.36 18.64a1.21 1.21 0 0 0 0 1.72l1.28 1.28a1.2 1.2 0 0 0 1.72 0L21.64 5.36a1.2 1.2 0 0 0 0-1.72"/><path d="m14 7 3 3"/><path d="M5 6v4"/><path d="M19 14v4"/><path d="M10 2v2"/><path d="M7 8H3"/><path d="M21 16h-4"/><path d="M11 3H9"/></svg></span><div><h3>Effortless editing</h3><p>Your words, your photographs, your colours. Make every detail yours.</p></div></article><article><span class="occasion-icon feature-icon" style="--occasion-hue:#2E8B6A"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 21a8 8 0 0 0-16 0"/><circle cx="10" cy="8" r="5"/><path d="M22 20c0-3.37-2-6.5-4-8a5 5 0 0 0-.45-8.3"/></svg></span><div><h3>Simple RSVP management</h3><p>Keep guest replies together, so you can focus on the celebration.</p></div></article></section><section class="studio-editorial home-only"><div class="studio-wrap editorial-grid"><div><p class="studio-kicker">The smallest details. The biggest feelings.</p><h2>A touch of<br><em>“how did they<br>do that?”</em></h2><p>Break a wax seal. Open a storybook. Scratch away a secret date. Little moments of delight, designed to be felt.</p><p style="margin-top:20px">Go on. Try the invitation beside you.</p></div><div><div class="interactive-sample" id="interactive-sample"></div><div class="sample-caption">Your first little surprise. ↑</div></div></div></section><section class="studio-steps studio-wrap home-only" id="how"><p class="studio-kicker">From a little idea to a lovely arrival</p><h2>How to create a digital invitation.</h2><div class="step-grid"><article class="step"><span>01 / Discover</span><h3>Find your feeling.</h3><p>Experience every design before choosing. Open it, scroll it, scratch it. Fall in love with the details.</p></article><article class="step"><span>02 / Make it yours</span><h3>Your story, beautifully told.</h3><p>Edit every word, upload your photographs, choose your colours. Preview the whole experience as you go.</p></article><article class="step"><span>03 / Bring everyone closer</span><h3>A link. A little magic.</h3><p>Choose your event date, complete secure checkout and publish. Share one link and collect guest replies.</p></article></div></section><section class="studio-wrap launch-pricing" aria-labelledby="home-pricing-title"><div><p class="studio-kicker">Simple pricing</p><h2 id="home-pricing-title">One invitation.<br>One payment.</h2><p>Personalise your invitation for free on this device. Pay when you’re ready to publish.</p></div><div><p class="launch-price" id="home-price">See invitation prices</p><p>Including VAT. No subscription.</p><p>Full editor, photo uploads, a shareable invitation and RSVP management. Editing stays open through your event date.</p><a class="studio-button" href="pricing.html">View pricing →</a></div></section><section class="studio-wrap invitation-explainer" aria-labelledby="explainer-title"><div><p class="studio-kicker">The modern invitation</p><h2 id="explainer-title">What is a digital invitation?</h2><p>A digital invitation is an interactive event page your guests open from one link or QR code. It holds everything a printed card does, plus your photos, story, schedule, venue map and online RSVP, and it can be updated whenever plans change.</p></div><div class="explainer-table" role="region" aria-label="Digital and printed invitations compared" tabindex="0"><table><caption class="sr-only">Digital invitations compared with printed invitations</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col"></th><th scope="col">Invitara digital</th><th scope="col">Printed card</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Delivery</th><td>Instant, by link or QR code</td><td>Post or hand delivery</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">RSVP</th><td>Online, tracked in your dashboard</td><td>Calls and messages to chase</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Changes</th><td>Edit until your event date</td><td>Reprint required</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Photos &amp; story</th><td>Gallery, schedule and venue map</td><td>One printed side</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cost</th><td>One payment per event</td><td>Per card, plus postage</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section class="studio-wrap launch-faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title"><p class="studio-kicker">A few helpful details</p><h2 id="faq-title">Digital invitation questions, answered.</h2><details><summary>Do guests need an app or an account to RSVP?</summary><p>No. Guests open your invitation link in any browser on their phone or computer and reply in seconds. Only you, the host, need an account.</p></details><details><summary>Can I share my invitation on WhatsApp?</summary><p>Yes. Every published invitation has one private link and a QR code, so you can share it by WhatsApp, text, email or social media, or print the QR code.</p></details><details><summary>How much does a digital invitation cost?</summary><p>Each invitation is a one-time payment per event, starting from AED 79 plus 5% VAT. There is no subscription, and you can personalise a draft for free before paying.</p></details><details><summary>Can I try a design before paying?</summary><p>Yes. Preview any design and customize a draft for free. Drafts stay in this browser. Sign in and pay to publish and save your invitation to your account.</p></details><details><summary>Who can see my invitation?</summary><p>Anyone with your published link can view it. Share it only with the people you want to invite. Guest replies are visible to the host.</p></details><details><summary>What happens after my event?</summary><p>Editing and guest replies close at midnight after the event in your chosen timezone. Your published invitation remains available as a keepsake.</p></details><details><summary>How do I recover my account?</summary><p>Save the private recovery key shown when you register. You’ll need it if you forget your password; we do not send password-reset emails.</p></details></section><section class="studio-end"><h2>Ready to create something beautiful?</h2><p>Your next unforgettable moment starts with a thoughtful invitation.</p><a class="studio-button lime" href="create.html">Create Your Invitation <span>→</span></a></section></main><div class="studio-wrap"><footer class="studio-footer">
