ed" tabindex="0"><table><caption class="sr-only">Digital invitations compared with printed invitations</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col"></th><th scope="col">Invitara digital</th><th scope="col">Printed card</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Delivery</th><td>Instant, by link or QR code</td><td>Post or hand delivery</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">RSVP</th><td>Online, tracked in your dashboard</td><td>Calls and messages to chase</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Changes</th><td>Edit until your event date</td><td>Reprint required</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Photos &amp; story</th><td>Gallery, schedule and venue map</td><td>One printed side</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cost</th><td>One payment per event</td><td>Per card, plus postage</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section class="studio-wrap launch-faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title"><p class="studio-kicker">A few helpful details</p><h2 id="faq-title">Digital invitation questions, answered.</h2><details><summary>Do guests need an app or an account to RSVP?</summary><p>No. Guests open your invitation link in any browser on their phone or computer and reply in seconds. Only you, the host, need an account.</p></details><details><summary>Can I share my invitation on WhatsApp?</summary><p>Yes. Every published invitation has one private link and a QR code, so you can share it by WhatsApp, text, email or social media, or print the QR code.</p></details><details><summary>How much does a digital invitation cost?</summary><p>Each invitation is a one-time payment per event, starting from AED 79 plus 5% VAT. There is no subscription, and you can personalise a draft for free before paying.</p></details><details><summary>Can I try a design before paying?</summary><p>Yes. Preview any design and customize a draft for free. Drafts stay in this browser. Sign in and pay to publish and save your invitation to your account.</p></details><details><summary>Who can see my invitation?</summary><p>Anyone with your published link can view it. Share it only with the people you want to invite. Guest replies are visible to the host.</p></details><details><summary>What happens after my event?</summary><p>Editing and guest replies close at midnight after the event in your chosen timezone. Your published invitation remains available as a keepsake.</p></details><details><summary>How do I recover my account?</summary><p>Save the private recovery key shown when you register. You’ll need it if you forget your password; we do not send password-reset emails.</p></details></section><section class="studio-end"><h2>Ready to create something beautiful?</h2><p>Your next unforgettable moment starts with a thoughtful invitation.</p><a class="studio-button lime" href="create.html">Create Your Invitation <span>→</span></a></section></main><div class="studio-wrap"><footer class="studio-footer">
   <div class="footer-brand"><a class="studio-logo" href="/">Invitara</a><p>Thoughtfully made.<br>Joyfully received.</p></div>
